---
import MainLayout from '../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
---

<MainLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="How we collect, use, and protect your data.">
  <div class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto prose">
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold !text-gray-900 mb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">Last updated: November 25, 2023</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold !text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Introduction</h2>
        <p class="!text-gray-700">Pyko is operated by DYXO SAS. The service enables users to transmit Salesforce alerts to Slack or Microsoft Teams, facilitating direct action from those platforms. This policy explains data handling practices across Pyko's websites.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold !text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Personal Data Collection</h2>
        <p class="!text-gray-700">Pyko gathers information varying by usage patterns and interaction type. The company defines personal data as any information identifiable with an individual, directly or indirectly.</p>
        <p class="!text-gray-700"><strong>Types collected include:</strong></p>
        <ul class="!text-gray-700">
          <li><strong>Identity information:</strong> Name, company, organization type, job title</li>
          <li><strong>Contact data:</strong> Address, email, telephone number</li>
          <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, browser details, timezone, location, OS, platform information</li>
          <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> Service interaction patterns and communications received</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold !text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Data Usage</h2>
        <p class="!text-gray-700">Users consent to information sharing when:</p>
        <ul class="!text-gray-700">
          <li>Providing requested services</li>
          <li>Engaging third-party service providers (limited to necessary data only)</li>
          <li>Sending service announcements and updates</li>
          <li>Acting on explicit user permission</li>
          <li>Required by law for urgent circumstances or public safety</li>
        </ul>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold !text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Data Ownership</h2>
        <p class="!text-gray-700">Pyko only passes information between Salesforce and Microsoft Teams or Slack. The company retains only statistical count data, never user emails or similar information. Users requesting data destruction need only contact support.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold !text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Data Access</h2>
        <p class="!text-gray-700">Access occurs for:</p>
        <ul class="!text-gray-700">
          <li>Service information provision</li>
          <li>Notifying about service changes</li>
          <li>Account administration</li>
          <li>Promotional material distribution (per policy terms)</li>
          <li>Service customization</li>
        </ul>
        <p class="!text-gray-700">Other site users access data only with appropriate rights or explicit permission. Their data use falls outside Pyko's control.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold !text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Data Aggregation</h2>
        <p class="!text-gray-700">Pyko uses aggregated, anonymized information to improve services and inform ecosystem trends.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold !text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Policy Updates & Transactions</h2>
        <p class="!text-gray-700">This policy applies to all data submissions. Pyko reserves rights to modify it. Should bankruptcy, merger, acquisition, reorganization, or asset sales occur, information may transfer to new entities maintaining these protections.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold !text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Data Storage Duration</h2>
        <p class="!text-gray-700">CRM data remains transient and never retained. Deleted user information stays archived in backups for maximum six months.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold !text-gray-900 mt-8 mb-4">Hosting</h2>
        <p class="!text-gray-700">Servers operate within the European Union. Providers include: Amazon Web Services, Clever-Cloud, Algolia, Scaleway.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
